  "body": "<p>When your Discord time comes to a close, here are the steps for logging out of your account. </p>\n<h2>Logging out is easy!</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the settings cog next to your user name &amp; avatar. <br><br><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360058008212\" alt=\"Capture4.jpg\" width=\"295\" height=\"74\"><br><br>\n</li>\n<li>Press the red <strong>Log Out</strong> button<br><br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360058008232\" alt=\"Capture5.jpg\"></p>\n<p>That's all it takes! We'll see you next time! </p>",
